  "description": "Modern WPF theme for .NET Framework and .NET 9. AtomicUI.WPF styles native WPF controls automatically, giving existing desktop apps a polished, premium, Windows 11-inspired interface without custom controls or heavy XAML rewrites.\n\n      Keep your existing XAML: no Atomic:Button, no ui:Button, no EditButton — just a normal Button styled automatically.\n\n      AtomicUI.WPF builds on Fluent design with deeper surfaces, smoother motion, refined spacing, and a more tactile professional feel than Microsoft’s default WPF themes.\n\n      Bring a modern 2026-grade UI to legacy and current WPF applications, including apps running on .NET Framework 4.5.1+. No migration to WinUI, MAUI, or a full redesign required.",
